<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19144" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fūsĭlis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		fundo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>molten</i>, <i>fluid</i>, <i>liquid</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 11, 126</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ferventes fusili ex argilla glandes fundis
					jacere coeperunt,</span>”
				i. e. <i>of softened clay</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 5, 43, 1</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀργίλλης τετηγμένης</span>,
			Metaphr.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">numen (i. e. signum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Cath. 4, 40</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vasa aenea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 8, 193</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Of molten metal</i>, <i>cast</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Vulg. 2
				Par. 4, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex aere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3
					Reg. 7, 16</span></i>
			.</div>
